1
00:00:01,301 --> 00:00:02,569
Summary:

2
00:00:02,569 --> 00:00:05,472
In summary,
there are a few specific rinses

3
00:00:05,472 --> 00:00:07,707
that will help prevent mucositis.

4
00:00:07,707 --> 00:00:10,010
Baking Soda and MuGuard.

5
00:00:10,010 --> 00:00:13,513
Please do these as instructed
from the start of radiation.

6
00:00:13,747 --> 00:00:16,950
The better you adhere to this,
the more you will be rewarded

7
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:19,152
later into the treatment.

8
00:00:19,152 --> 00:00:22,922
It is important to do this step
even if you are not experiencing

9
00:00:22,922 --> 00:00:25,558
mucositis or pain.

10
00:00:25,558 --> 00:00:27,494
If the mucositis worsens,

11
00:00:27,494 --> 00:00:33,066
we may add numbing medications, lidocaine
or pain relieving medication.

12
00:00:33,066 --> 00:00:36,536
Doxepin or Morphine
to help you through it.

13
00:00:36,669 --> 00:00:40,340
It is important that you follow closely
how to use them.

14
00:00:40,440 --> 00:00:43,443
Please feel free to watch
and rewatch the videos

15
00:00:43,443 --> 00:00:46,413
to make sure they are clear to you
before using.

16
00:00:46,579 --> 00:00:50,483
And feel free to ask our team
any questions to help clarify.

17
00:00:50,617 --> 00:00:52,385
Thank you for watching.
